@VitalQ_API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5089

### 0. Create an Admin User Account
POST {{VitalQ_API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "AdminPassword123",
  "fullName": "System Administrator",
  "phoneNumber": "9998887770"
}

### 1. Create a Department (Cardiology)
POST {{VitalQ_API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cardiology",
  "code": "CARD",
  "locationFloor": "2nd Floor"
}

### 2. Get All Departments
GET {{VitalQ_API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/departments
Accept: application/json

### 3. Update a Department (Replace {id} with actual department ID)
PUT {{VitalQ_API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/departments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cardiology & Vascular Center",
  "locationFloor": "2nd Floor, Wing B",
  "isActive": true
}

### 4. Create a General Nursing Station
POST {{VitalQ_API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/nursing-stations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stationName": "Main Triage Desk 1",
  "locationFloor": "Ground Floor"
}

### 5. Create a Department-Linked Nursing Station
POST {{VitalQ_API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/nursing-stations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stationName": "Cardio Triage Desk A",
  "departmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "locationFloor": "2nd Floor"
}

### 6. Get All Nursing Stations (or filter: ?departmentId=...)
GET {{VitalQ_API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/nursing-stations
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get All Doctors
GET {{VitalQ_API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/doctors
Accept: application/json

### 8. Create a Doctor (Paste the departmentId from step 1)
POST {{VitalQ_API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "dr.smith",
  "password": "Doctor123",
  "fullName": "Dr. John Smith",
  "phoneNumber": "9876543210",
  "departmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "specialization": "Cardiologist",
  "roomNumber": "Room 204",
  "avgConsultationMinutes": 10
}

### 9. Update Doctor Details
PUT {{VitalQ_API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/doctors/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Dr. John A. Smith",
  "phoneNumber": "9876543210",
  "departmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "specialization": "Interventional Cardiologist",
  "roomNumber": "Room 205",
  "status": "Available",
  "avgConsultationMinutes": 15
}

### 10. Toggle Doctor Status
PATCH {{VitalQ_API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/doctors/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Available"
}

### 10. Get All Patients Directory with Visit Histories
GET {{VitalQ_API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/patients
Accept: application/json

### 11. Get Single Patient Details with Visit History
GET {{VitalQ_API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/patients/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
